---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import Schema from '../components/Schema.astro';
---
<BaseLayout
  title="About TMG Plumbing & Heating | Waterford"
  description="TMG Plumbing & Heating Services has provided residential and commercial heating solutions across the South East of Ireland since 2006."
>
  <Schema />
  <section class="bg-mist border-b border-navy/10">
    <div class="mx-auto max-w-4xl px-4 py-16">
      <h1 class="text-3xl md:text-4xl font-medium text-navy">About TMG</h1>
      <p class="mt-4 text-navy/70 max-w-2xl">
        South East Ireland's plumbing and heating specialist since 2006.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="mx-auto max-w-3xl px-4 py-16 space-y-6 text-navy/80 leading-relaxed">
    <p>
      TMG Plumbing & Heating Services was founded by Tony McGuinness in 2006.
      Since then, the company has grown into the South East's leading
      specialist in domestic and commercial heating, serving homeowners
      across Waterford, Wexford, Kilkenny, Tipperary and Kildare, and
      commercial clients nationwide.
    </p>
    <p>
      Our work covers power flushing, underfloor heating, leak detection,
      demineralisation, oil boiler installation, general plumbing and
      heating, and drinking water filtration. We've worked with clients
      including Guinness, Bulmers, SSE Airtricity and Waterford Distillery,
      alongside thousands of domestic customers across the region.
    </p>
    <p>
      Every job is quoted with a fixed price before work begins, and
      emergency callouts are available outside standard office hours.
    </p>
    <div class="pt-4 flex gap-3">
      <a href="/contact" class="rounded bg-orange text-white font-medium px-6 py-3 hover:bg-orange-dark">Get a quote</a>
      <a href="tel:051577089" class="rounded border border-navy/20 text-navy px-6 py-3 hover:border-orange hover:text-orange">Call 051 577 089</a>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
